Good advice for non-wizards, but IMHO wizards are served better by being 
high level. The large pool of Energy and the increase in spell damage is 
really nice, and it increases success rates for spells. Also nice to be 
able to advance spell skills. When I ascended my wizard (yes, only once) 
I never passed about lvl 17, and when I ascended I was actually down to 
level 13. I had SERIOUS problems casting spells at that point, both from 
lost skill levels and lower XL.

Potions of gain level are probably better left for the end run. I 
normally gain a lot of levels through Wraiths, and any others are easily 
gained with foocubi (average 5 per foocubi, if your stats are high 
enough). You should be able to gain levels easy enough if you know what 
you're doing.

